# Normalize everything to LF regardless of what OS/editor checks it out
# or commits it. Without this, a contributor with core.autocrlf=true (or
# an editor that rewrites line endings) can accidentally convert every
# tracked file to CRLF in one commit, which breaks `gofmt -l` in CI and
# makes every subsequent diff noisy.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
